window.EXAUD={"Can you say that again, please?": "audio/cau/7e3810543bbdcfd8.mp3", "Mi read the story again and again.": "audio/cau/1afa85aeab810227.mp3", "My parents allow me to play games at weekends.": "audio/cau/0e78db317452b06e.mp3", "The park doesn't allow bikes; it bans them.": "audio/cau/cf368ad5bb4a58ec.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "We live in an apartment on the tenth floor.": "audio/cau/4e92ae5a41f11424.mp3", "Nam's family moved to a new flat in a big apartment building.": "audio/cau/9d5250ee060002c6.mp3", "I use an app to learn English.": "audio/cau/8b5de3a8ea891fe1.mp3", "Lan downloaded a new app; this application helps her book taxis.": "audio/cau/1b345290c5e399e1.mp3", "There are many useful apps for students.": "audio/cau/03ccde264f0438bc.mp3", "This app is free, but those apps are expensive.": "audio/cau/70732b1ff6e3364d.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "Art is my favourite subject at school.": "audio/cau/c4a6c2883e22b179.mp3", "Lan loves art, and she wants to be an artist.": "audio/cau/0ae231fa580deb96.mp3", "The artist paints pictures of Hoi An.": "audio/cau/01b6df3137316ebd.mp3", "Minh studies art because he wants to be an artist.": "audio/cau/42793539c55d19cc.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "Ha Long Bay is a World Heritage Site.": "audio/cau/5a085a89254963b8.mp3", "There are thousands of islands in the bay.": "audio/cau/4cf873f6cc8fd985.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is bigger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/5efe9fe286047142.mp3", "My house is big, but Nam's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/44f8b6366001f6da.mp3", "She wrote a book about her life.": "audio/cau/428afa8d58f841a3.mp3", "Lan reads a book every week, so she has many books.": "audio/cau/5a4070779479f823.mp3", "I like reading books about animals.": "audio/cau/161e5202b70a9850.mp3", "This book is mine, and those books are Nam's.": "audio/cau/564922fbe3abbd87.mp3", "There is a bookshelf next to my bed.": "audio/cau/28c26e10a15e44bb.mp3", "We have one bookshelf in the living room and two bookshelves upstairs.": "audio/cau/1f773c2cd37855a0.mp3", "Let's meet at the bookshop at three.": "audio/cau/edd3dfa5312f3d80.mp3", "Mi buys books at the bookshop near her school.": "audio/cau/f582ec87c6413bc0.mp3", "My sister is a bookworm; she reads all day.": "audio/cau/c8db770130f6abe1.mp3", "Nam is a bookworm and has hundreds of books.": "audio/cau/8d410197b8c04d62.mp3", "My mother bought me a new bag.": "audio/cau/393d28dd65ad4177.mp3", "Nam wants to buy a book; yesterday he bought two.": "audio/cau/9953418f62bdd3ef.mp3", "Please bring your English book tomorrow.": "audio/cau/cd49561735d6690b.mp3", "Exams can bring about a lot of stress.": "audio/cau/4bcd1f108e558b55.mp3", "I want to buy a new lamp for my room.": "audio/cau/f0b3e6851a8b52eb.mp3", "Mum bought a sofa, and Dad wants to sell the old one.": "audio/cau/59add360cbe991b8.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "I call my grandparents every Sunday.": "audio/cau/2d274e78a6c843f7.mp3", "Mi phoned Lan, but Lan didn't answer the call.": "audio/cau/5828a7c8ea6b7c57.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "My dad goes to work by car.": "audio/cau/9da1d69f2607f513.mp3", "There are more cars in the city than in the village.": "audio/cau/cff85749cb66c62f.mp3", "My grandmother is kind and caring.": "audio/cau/a03423bedfa41d41.mp3", "Hoa is caring. She takes care of her little sister.": "audio/cau/7cc44adf2286a858.mp3", "They carried out a study about city life.": "audio/cau/741e882cd91f0aed.mp3", "The old buses carried many passengers.": "audio/cau/1d29e18f669abb89.mp3", "Can you help me carry this box?": "audio/cau/a0f121aef5c03fe7.mp3", "Lan carried her books, and today she carries her bag.": "audio/cau/e736c67580379245.mp3", "There are too many cars on the road.": "audio/cau/af9e36fc967bfae5.mp3", "This car is new, but those cars are old.": "audio/cau/a9c38aadea83ed91.mp3", "We use the possessive case to show who owns something: Mi's bag.": "audio/cau/3276a3613027350f.mp3", "My pencil case is on the desk.": "audio/cau/777c125591c7b388.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "The girls are chatting in the playground.": "audio/cau/893aa9d28a50147c.mp3", "Hoa likes to chat, and now she is chatting with Chi.": "audio/cau/52dae974c0fd7e47.mp3", "The baby has chubby cheeks.": "audio/cau/4d2de404c797ef95.mp3", "My brother was chubby, but now he is thin.": "audio/cau/744be57209c1189a.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Our school has twenty classes.": "audio/cau/c3a891dc027e3741.mp3", "We have English classes on Monday.": "audio/cau/cd49a2bc4c3e1c86.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "Thanks to garbage collectors, our streets are clean.": "audio/cau/daef4e3fa0819a5e.mp3", "We clean the streets every weekend.": "audio/cau/d0801c735785b87e.mp3", "The cleaner works early in the morning.": "audio/cau/2d62413dec6c90b6.mp3", "The street cleaner cleans the road every day.": "audio/cau/e156ac2a11c8608f.mp3", "My mum cleans the house on Sundays.": "audio/cau/8324be56690a27b3.mp3", "The cleaner cleans our classroom after school.": "audio/cau/86fdefaae1ab3c06.mp3", "Close your lips, then open them to say /b/.": "audio/cau/1c12f29d1557a6a6.mp3", "Please close the window; it's cold.": "audio/cau/20e2820b500dbcb2.mp3", "Let's take a closer look at the words.": "audio/cau/3f25d4a7ecb1e46f.mp3", "Lan's house is close, but Mi's house is closer.": "audio/cau/95aeed65b79a000e.mp3", "We communicate with friends by email.": "audio/cau/71c0cac04361b2eb.mp3", "Good communication helps us communicate better.": "audio/cau/83b537bc6eb88878.mp3", "Communication is important in a team.": "audio/cau/ceae7194d8982d8f.mp3", "We communicate in English to improve our communication skills.": "audio/cau/78dbdceb83728ae8.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "He bought his first computer at sixteen.": "audio/cau/89b36254c871cb46.mp3", "She studied computing and now makes computer games.": "audio/cau/bc002ad22303f977.mp3", "Listen to the conversation and answer.": "audio/cau/9f48e7934c974946.mp3", "Mi had a short chat, not a long conversation.": "audio/cau/e32ab06f1cea65e6.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "Count the cars on the road.": "audio/cau/2f77ea8e9602daf4.mp3", "'Book' is countable, but 'water' is uncountable.": "audio/cau/1f443af6fff942cf.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "It is dark outside now.": "audio/cau/48eaca11c1014cbe.mp3", "Minh's room is dark, so he turns on the light.": "audio/cau/8c6105f992faba73.mp3", "Match each word with its definition.": "audio/cau/ce1a413bb9b18090.mp3", "Can you define this word? Read its definition first.": "audio/cau/0a03b83109a0e126.mp3", "Read the definitions and find the words.": "audio/cau/e1aa84a2fed6f514.mp3", "The dictionary defines 'craft' and gives two definitions.": "audio/cau/37e4701dbc025d6c.mp3", "Can you describe your house?": "audio/cau/a0d5ad73f19e51bc.mp3", "Describe your friend and read your description to the class.": "audio/cau/5e8b000dcde9e11f.mp3", "We are describing people's appearance.": "audio/cau/6bc282b943512d78.mp3", "Lan is good at describing, and her description is lively.": "audio/cau/1a8ee4d3d58fbfa0.mp3", "Write a short description of your friend.": "audio/cau/1d3f9d3cf060662c.mp3", "Phong describes his school, and his description is funny.": "audio/cau/9801d95651b1cda6.mp3", "She wants to design clothes when she grows up.": "audio/cau/73e28be0aedd98a0.mp3", "Hoa is a designer; she designs school uniforms.": "audio/cau/654b4ba1f4bbceb2.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "I don't like rainy days.": "audio/cau/111328217b7f4b84.mp3", "We don't play games, but Minh does.": "audio/cau/851ce9fc9da85e82.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Can you draw a cat?": "audio/cau/be2932fbc93e80e5.mp3", "Hoa drew a flower and gave me the drawing.": "audio/cau/8ef26c64079b1115.mp3", "Lan's drawing is on the wall.": "audio/cau/e1c99913c9bb1dcf.mp3", "Minh draws well. He drew this drawing yesterday.": "audio/cau/a06a821e60587e14.mp3", "My brother draws pictures of animals.": "audio/cau/f72f002c0ce9c3b5.mp3", "Mi draws every day, and last week she drew a horse.": "audio/cau/c53f78fbfbf3ff78.mp3", "Do exercise e on page ten.": "audio/cau/f397a6a2157f10ba.mp3", "The word 'eye' starts with the letter e.": "audio/cau/5f2132c30b4b4b2f.mp3", "Mi makes friends easily at school.": "audio/cau/eedb13c811943ed4.mp3", "The test was easy, so I finished it easily.": "audio/cau/7cb7e2c3342cf293.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "An effective routine helps Lan finish her work on time.": "audio/cau/84276eb90c207b00.mp3", "Making a to-do list is an effective way to plan.": "audio/cau/31434b2c1fe51913.mp3", "If you want to manage your time effectively, you should make a plan.": "audio/cau/f1df3c23b5363c7c.mp3", "Minh studies effectively in a quiet room.": "audio/cau/371317aebfcad0c8.mp3", "Lan uses a to-do list to manage her time efficiently.": "audio/cau/481514ebc581deea.mp3", "If you work efficiently, you will have more free time.": "audio/cau/0f0bc45d107c3f7e.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "Cities offer lots of entertainment.": "audio/cau/63cf66848c4eb0b8.mp3", "The show entertains children, so it is good entertainment.": "audio/cau/2e7c63c4052fabc6.mp3", "I do my homework in the evening.": "audio/cau/4615eb9cc8fbce85.mp3", "Good evening! We have dinner every evening at seven.": "audio/cau/737b0c650458cf41.mp3", "Finishing university was a big event in her life.": "audio/cau/d02d8535b61fc941.mp3", "Our school has many events, and Sports Day is the biggest event.": "audio/cau/bf9231674b220ac3.mp3", "Write about the main events in his life.": "audio/cau/d6337484dc329c56.mp3", "The festival was a big event with many fun events.": "audio/cau/b6b0e53a84350bf6.mp3", "Look at the example first.": "audio/cau/738e63739d26fe10.mp3", "Give an example; for example, cat is a noun.": "audio/cau/dc9ac2f421dfc6ef.mp3", "Many families live in flats in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/0f99802cf5d0ebaf.mp3", "Families get together at Tet.": "audio/cau/60357c1a8fa848a4.mp3", "There are four people in my family.": "audio/cau/8324f70f7fed9e74.mp3", "Many families in my village grow rice.": "audio/cau/5b179b43939643fc.mp3", "Hoi An is famous for its lanterns.": "audio/cau/be0831db3c3bf621.mp3", "General Giap became famous, and his fame spread worldwide.": "audio/cau/4eabd5e77fd10a06.mp3", "I cut my finger with a knife.": "audio/cau/872f7e5261595bf7.mp3", "We have ten fingers and ten toes.": "audio/cau/be3aaa7025efac86.mp3", "Lan has long fingers; she plays the piano.": "audio/cau/5a44a02d2a0bce01.mp3", "Each hand has five fingers, and one finger is the thumb.": "audio/cau/26cab787bcc77947.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "We live in a flat in the city centre.": "audio/cau/d0952d39ace4e187.mp3", "Mi's flat is small, but it has a nice balcony.": "audio/cau/5bb5801d0d7e1e94.mp3", "In my future city, people live in smart flats.": "audio/cau/2647fcaf50d15541.mp3", "My aunt lives in a flat in a block of flats.": "audio/cau/edb1d75dbb47094e.mp3", "Minh lives on the fifth floor.": "audio/cau/17f068310aaa9769.mp3", "Mi's town house has three floors.": "audio/cau/049f5e6113f37c5d.mp3", "My bedroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/58f076886cf1907b.mp3", "Follow the steps to make your poster.": "audio/cau/6579733e7f4abc4a.mp3", "Minh followed his teacher's advice and passed the exam.": "audio/cau/9fff6306c664e2d9.mp3", "Answer the following questions.": "audio/cau/7a648aa7c194b903.mp3", "We followed the plan the following day.": "audio/cau/f2e1b58551411942.mp3", "What do you do in your free time?": "audio/cau/561d82e572a21e67.mp3", "I am busy today, but I am free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/ed0144aa5c166e1b.mp3", "We have fun at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/042795d03f276893.mp3", "The game was fun, and Nam's jokes were funny.": "audio/cau/1343a6a406625409.mp3", "My new school is further from home.": "audio/cau/75bf280216804478.mp3", "Hoa walks far, but Minh walks further.": "audio/cau/2debf8693d0b2c6c.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "We play a game in our English class.": "audio/cau/f89d92956bddd8c5.mp3", "My brother is a gamer, and he loves this game.": "audio/cau/5869b678fdd00fcc.mp3", "We play games at break time.": "audio/cau/d7be6e5b8ac32945.mp3", "Nam likes computer games, but his favourite game is chess.": "audio/cau/7f58cb7638af0917.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "Can you guess who my best friend is?": "audio/cau/a4917a427747dd81.mp3", "Nam made a guess, and his guess was right.": "audio/cau/c99f05a28ed90339.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "Our house is near the river.": "audio/cau/462620c6e9d42610.mp3", "Lan's house is big, so the housework takes a long time.": "audio/cau/ffae3b516fc16794.mp3", "Lan helps her mother with the housework.": "audio/cau/603758dd29202743.mp3", "I do housework at weekends, like cleaning the house.": "audio/cau/603861c40de6e77e.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "After 'How about', we use the verb with -ing.": "audio/cau/0b5b2f5d668491cd.mp3", "How about buying a new lamp for your bedroom?": "audio/cau/55a020c7bbf1ac54.mp3", "Music is his greatest interest.": "audio/cau/01ea6b9ecb917ed3.mp3", "Minh has an interest in history, so he is interested in museums.": "audio/cau/218a4f41f5587ba6.mp3", "She was interested in science from an early age.": "audio/cau/34d48dff42b1323f.mp3", "Lan is interested in the book because it is interesting.": "audio/cau/916ab5cb0684d54c.mp3", "City life is interesting but stressful.": "audio/cau/d3da66e08dd099e1.mp3", "The film is interesting, and everyone is interested in it.": "audio/cau/4a91c463480dae58.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "Minh finished his project just before the due date.": "audio/cau/6a8c8ece8bd3699e.mp3", "Hoa arrived just before the test started.": "audio/cau/ddc502e35be5489a.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "We should keep our streets clean.": "audio/cau/3f2dd8440f55f148.mp3", "Lan kept her old toys, and she still keeps them.": "audio/cau/d20c525ce8b90756.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "There is a lamp on my desk.": "audio/cau/80d55c1669ed8758.mp3", "Turn on the lamp; the light is too weak.": "audio/cau/19093375e9e548a3.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is larger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/34248d77fe6d06a4.mp3", "Ha Noi is large, but Ho Chi Minh City is larger.": "audio/cau/8d6bb314d8a84f29.mp3", "They are learning English now.": "audio/cau/dd1a1d45e6dbee72.mp3", "Mi is learning to swim; she learnt a lot last week.": "audio/cau/f28b08757f5f0cdc.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "Let me help you with your bags.": "audio/cau/41dd52ad0f012862.mp3", "Mum let me go out yesterday; she lets me go on Sundays.": "audio/cau/46fc2d4c33221e5d.mp3", "Stop when the traffic light is red.": "audio/cau/dd4921089bcbaa08.mp3", "Turn on the light, please; the room is dark.": "audio/cau/dd20920a13027c13.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "Mai is making a birthday card for Lan.": "audio/cau/dc70bb88704df4a4.mp3", "We are making paper flowers; we made ten yesterday.": "audio/cau/2de37c2668104819.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures.": "audio/cau/c554f0656d3ab896.mp3", "Match the names with the photos and connect them with lines.": "audio/cau/b9cb7dc9f6dfba6f.mp3", "What does 'craft village' mean?": "audio/cau/4c5a16ea9baf9474.mp3", "What do these words mean? Let's check their meaning.": "audio/cau/2a235e867bbba30d.mp3", "Some English words have two meanings.": "audio/cau/c6e4715d74edc5b6.mp3", "One word can have many meanings, so check what it means here.": "audio/cau/6b80e6c4dbc628c3.mp3", "Mai sends me a message every evening.": "audio/cau/a9c6b25a2357a625.mp3", "Can I leave a message for Mr Minh?": "audio/cau/5ea5e2442839d4cb.mp3", "Phone messages can distract Hoa when she studies.": "audio/cau/28c90eaebe18183b.mp3", "Nam answers his messages after finishing homework.": "audio/cau/7a19f2c647edbc82.mp3", "I get up at six every morning.": "audio/cau/838c5da1aad62be2.mp3", "We study in the morning and play in the evening.": "audio/cau/8a176d8289d946ce.mp3", "The people in my neighbourhood are mostly friendly.": "audio/cau/54584631f0893d3f.mp3", "We mostly travel by bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/05f1e9640ad3b61c.mp3", "My family will move to Da Nang next year.": "audio/cau/52a8b01da231ec79.mp3", "We moved to a new flat, and we don't want to move again.": "audio/cau/1f00cc6fb33d58c8.mp3", "Moving to a new city can be hard.": "audio/cau/2fa286a0802dcc57.mp3", "They are moving to Ha Noi because they want to move near work.": "audio/cau/7d2136ef12f1a387.mp3", "I listen to music every evening.": "audio/cau/947b04b66aabe669.mp3", "Phong loves music, and he wants to be a musician.": "audio/cau/2a338296f019ee09.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "We need more parks in the city.": "audio/cau/fa790aed3aa20742.mp3", "Plants need water, and Mi needs some help.": "audio/cau/43af483482c3e17f.mp3", "The village needs a new bridge.": "audio/cau/1beac53452ba3355.mp3", "Nam needs a pen, and I need one too.": "audio/cau/bd84b90357a9da88.mp3", "She never gave up her dream.": "audio/cau/b95a5dea82e7f24d.mp3", "Never give up; always try your best.": "audio/cau/45044467beb1d1bf.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "There is too much noise from the traffic.": "audio/cau/618afe734d9580d5.mp3", "The noise is loud, and the street is very noisy.": "audio/cau/71cde03703f63654.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "Make a note of the new words.": "audio/cau/8bdaf02876855cac.mp3", "I write a short note in my notebook.": "audio/cau/3b565057bfcdee58.mp3", "I write new words in my notebook.": "audio/cau/54f4386b8856f178.mp3", "Mi's notebook is full of short notes.": "audio/cau/684bf34705fb9a6b.mp3", "Take notes while you listen.": "audio/cau/a76ebe77aa288aab.mp3", "I write a short note and keep all my notes in a notebook.": "audio/cau/26f4f6be6ec1126c.mp3", "Nowadays, many people live in big cities.": "audio/cau/2031df910036a3d3.mp3", "Nowadays, or these days, life is busier than before.": "audio/cau/aea1a0fa8f3a8489.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "There is only one bed in my bedroom.": "audio/cau/000e91b12face3a4.mp3", "Lan is an only child; she has just one cousin.": "audio/cau/b6ec9a93c21bdf30.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "I need a new pair of shoes for school.": "audio/cau/250c1c4ccfb0d448.mp3", "Find a partner and work in pairs.": "audio/cau/9f9cc8d6f86e7886.mp3", "Work in pairs and ask each other questions.": "audio/cau/2bae203d74ef1339.mp3", "There are ten pairs, so each pair gets one card.": "audio/cau/6a0e4948c63a816b.mp3", "Ask your partner about his favourite food.": "audio/cau/422fdd4d69934397.mp3", "Minh is my partner, and we work in pairs.": "audio/cau/c79cf650c67747ae.mp3", "Can I borrow your pen, please?": "audio/cau/219492b77e8bce23.mp3", "Write in pen, not in pencil.": "audio/cau/61e51310622e9a99.mp3", "I draw a picture with my pencil.": "audio/cau/ecf39c9e499950e3.mp3", "Put your pen and pencil in your pencil case.": "audio/cau/cebdbe1b42b4a461.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "I use my phone to call my grandparents.": "audio/cau/8e9996c8fa495f09.mp3", "Lan phoned me last night on her new phone.": "audio/cau/8ac9d116e44bf63f.mp3", "Can you take a photo of us?": "audio/cau/4e7337681afc841a.mp3", "This photo is a nice picture of my class.": "audio/cau/94f608c9dc656d2b.mp3", "Look at the photos of my friends.": "audio/cau/8a988a56d17dddc5.mp3", "Mi takes a photo, and Lan takes many photos.": "audio/cau/df1811e9acc25b9a.mp3", "Look at the picture and describe the man.": "audio/cau/b1d73989f1f7619c.mp3", "Hoa draws a picture, and Nam takes a photo of it.": "audio/cau/40c2b9c3207a7713.mp3", "Mi draws beautiful pictures in art class.": "audio/cau/1037e2e30ff7fb85.mp3", "We took many photos and put the pictures on the wall.": "audio/cau/5ddc63bf192b9304.mp3", "We need a plan for our project.": "audio/cau/e33a8fe9fb341903.mp3", "Nam planned his trip carefully with his family.": "audio/cau/f61c169a10484b3b.mp3", "We should use less plastic.": "audio/cau/6086cc4fcde84c05.mp3", "Bring a cloth bag instead of a plastic bag.": "audio/cau/9da1cfd8517ef4f4.mp3", "Can I ask you a question, Ms Hoa?": "audio/cau/7e99e348210556f2.mp3", "Nam asks a question, and Mi gives the answer.": "audio/cau/269c53bfb0db8e6f.mp3", "The teacher asks us three questions.": "audio/cau/9e7c27a7a37e13a0.mp3", "Read the questions carefully and write your answers.": "audio/cau/7fcc03272c2a6124.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "I would rather live in the countryside.": "audio/cau/6dda681626477794.mp3", "The city is rather noisy, so I prefer my village.": "audio/cau/476387036c11f54e.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "How does Elena reply to her mum?": "audio/cau/dcaf59d7091175e8.mp3", "Please reply to my email soon.": "audio/cau/1fbb259adb0f0a8b.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "This robot can help people clean the house.": "audio/cau/abb1c1ffc510fec1.mp3", "Nam has a robot and many other robotic toys.": "audio/cau/180c8c82c4eb569d.mp3", "The table in our living room is round.": "audio/cau/f7f856ccb720a89e.mp3", "The Earth is round like a ball.": "audio/cau/bb61c7563d06ea8c.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "Read the sample answer before you write.": "audio/cau/ea7645ef6a324d03.mp3", "This sample is a good example of a life story.": "audio/cau/c91d20f5c55e871f.mp3", "Mum says breakfast is ready.": "audio/cau/4bcfdde7be1c67e6.mp3", "Yesterday the teacher said 'Good job', and today she says it again.": "audio/cau/2213f432702e6aed.mp3", "Mi can see Nick on the screen.": "audio/cau/c8c3087e011d478f.mp3", "The screen of my laptop is small.": "audio/cau/49245b6639f040cf.mp3", "They sell fresh vegetables at the market.": "audio/cau/052ed543aa37b44c.mp3", "Grandma sold flowers; she was a kind seller.": "audio/cau/ea04b190084d53ff.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "Let's go to the shop to buy a lamp.": "audio/cau/02d8310bb74af7bc.mp3", "There is a small shop near my house.": "audio/cau/e63a93ab9fc8033d.mp3", "My mum goes shopping on Sunday mornings.": "audio/cau/9edd7bc7a6da8213.mp3", "Mi likes shopping at the small shops near her house.": "audio/cau/9b5fc040769efc5a.mp3", "There are many shops along this street.": "audio/cau/f8d089fcbdb1b89b.mp3", "My aunt has a small shop near the school.": "audio/cau/d1a736005c66edb9.mp3", "You should eat more vegetables.": "audio/cau/d3873c12c668ddab.mp3", "We should recycle, and we shouldn't waste water.": "audio/cau/bdd4848df2193265.mp3", "You shouldn't stay up too late.": "audio/cau/680bdbc9338f8ccb.mp3", "You should sleep early and shouldn't skip breakfast.": "audio/cau/a2f566a8bdd973cf.mp3", "Show your photos to the class.": "audio/cau/2238dc578e393ea6.mp3", "Nam showed us photos of his village.": "audio/cau/212c93e8427b7095.mp3", "The timeline shows the important events in his life.": "audio/cau/842231fd94ad1d43.mp3", "This photo shows my grandfather as a young man.": "audio/cau/f9a1966a7b553101.mp3", "Use simple words in your presentation.": "audio/cau/685b89e962568275.mp3", "The task is simple; simply read and answer.": "audio/cau/f9dad5cdcce61ac9.mp3", "We sing English songs in class.": "audio/cau/026846f6b8826235.mp3", "Mi sang a song; she is a good singer.": "audio/cau/880ccad023e24637.mp3", "What size are your new shoes?": "audio/cau/05cfc304e1b5b3c5.mp3", "This T-shirt is the right size for me.": "audio/cau/41ec9665d4cc708c.mp3", "My sister is tall and slim.": "audio/cau/ae9d629687e345be.mp3", "Mi is slim, but she isn't too thin.": "audio/cau/b60ca5ae77435297.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "My village is smaller than the city.": "audio/cau/77ad0931648736fe.mp3", "This shop is small, but that one is even smaller.": "audio/cau/0d67ec98fa2886f3.mp3", "Ha Noi is planning to become a smart city.": "audio/cau/534a2d2742fd455c.mp3", "My smart cousin made an app for smartphones.": "audio/cau/a451335c10c8aa7f.mp3", "Many teenagers use a smartphone every day.": "audio/cau/5ebfc7f85b461743.mp3", "Nam's smartphone is smart: it can translate English.": "audio/cau/023fcc72924c361c.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "This is my favourite song.": "audio/cau/541e14c148c17e10.mp3", "Let's sing a song together!": "audio/cau/2582c08c2be3a294.mp3", "Please sort the rubbish before you throw it away.": "audio/cau/6c05fa141d6fcfcf.mp3", "What sort of rubbish can we recycle?": "audio/cau/ece2a3deda17cf66.mp3", "Which word has the sound /əʊ/?": "audio/cau/abdd497b61506cce.mp3", "I love the sound of the rain at night.": "audio/cau/6a34a72a03c00f3a.mp3", "Listen and repeat the sounds /b/ and /p/.": "audio/cau/82fd56c054a4daa9.mp3", "The /b/ sound in 'robe' is voiced.": "audio/cau/1a965cfa2b894959.mp3", "Speaking English is fun for me.": "audio/cau/5e0c5c8f032037bd.mp3", "Phong spoke very well at the speaking contest last week.": "audio/cau/a7b7e89c25abf298.mp3", "Tet is a special time for Vietnamese families.": "audio/cau/5f60a4fd69577fbf.mp3", "Com is a speciality of Ha Noi, and it's very special.": "audio/cau/d7109b486b9421a3.mp3", "Bun cha is a speciality of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/a2c2b048e7347b92.mp3", "This cake is special; it is a speciality of Hue.": "audio/cau/e7c18f248052be04.mp3", "The first step is to choose a topic.": "audio/cau/ec4db97a726f21df.mp3", "Follow the guide step by step.": "audio/cau/2f133f370e2fb508.mp3", "Follow these steps to make a poster.": "audio/cau/98072d2331910aac.mp3", "The last step is to show your poster to the class.": "audio/cau/4892be374595ef8d.mp3", "The store is near our house.": "audio/cau/499a1bc50d7cd647.mp3", "Let's go to the store this weekend.": "audio/cau/df90dc123d86e998.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "Lan is studying for her English test now.": "audio/cau/cb697036271d7db2.mp3", "The students are studying in the library.": "audio/cau/3e449c654c7e4156.mp3", "I suggest going to the park this weekend.": "audio/cau/b74fff5b8419072a.mp3", "Thanks for your suggestion; I suggest the same idea.": "audio/cau/110fe9165afb36a5.mp3", "Give your partner a suggestion: How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/0bf0c315e50c7d4c.mp3", "Thanks for your suggestion. It's a great idea!": "audio/cau/dc4b8e923e5f1ca3.mp3", "Our teacher suggests reading English books.": "audio/cau/b0d6f34c7837f298.mp3", "Nam suggests going by bus; it is a good suggestion.": "audio/cau/405fc1bf5cfa80a5.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "Mi is taking photos of the flowers.": "audio/cau/13a0bae7bf3bc40c.mp3", "We are taking a bus now; we took a train last week.": "audio/cau/5e43700c2b0ef208.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "Mi and Lan are talking about their new house.": "audio/cau/db4593c0356937da.mp3", "Nam is talkative; he is always talking in class.": "audio/cau/40601d08103ee713.mp3", "Please tell me about your hometown.": "audio/cau/d5098eae824e03fa.mp3", "My grandpa told me a story last night.": "audio/cau/ba19b792ce3534dc.mp3", "Mi often tells funny jokes in class.": "audio/cau/a45b431c2cc8b2fc.mp3", "Hoa tells me everything; yesterday she told me a secret.": "audio/cau/0bfc816828146f08.mp3", "Read the two texts and compare them.": "audio/cau/c807be1a6c25d189.mp3", "Mi sends me texts every day; this text is from her.": "audio/cau/2bea2a0f26cc7d4b.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "The little cat is very thin.": "audio/cau/8c1ed6a4edac2bf8.mp3", "Lan is thin, but her little brother is chubby.": "audio/cau/06ddcea82b187e52.mp3", "I think he is a great person.": "audio/cau/9ae2e70b49a3159f.mp3", "I thought about his story, and I think it is true.": "audio/cau/9f8df7704c81c77d.mp3", "What time is it now, Mum?": "audio/cau/1cbca6b4e0afa66c.mp3", "Look at the timetable; it is time for maths.": "audio/cau/9b6fb48058293171.mp3", "Today is Monday, and I have maths.": "audio/cau/a2c1db38d6bad1f7.mp3", "It is sunny today, so we play outside.": "audio/cau/43f448f8abe01280.mp3", "I'm optimistic about the exam I took last week.": "audio/cau/98111979a0b1df4c.mp3", "Minh took the bus to school.": "audio/cau/d8fe913a07c52d8e.mp3", "I tried to accomplish my goal of cycling five kilometres a day.": "audio/cau/3db6bdb7b910b612.mp3", "Hoa tried to finish her homework early.": "audio/cau/1e93b2dcd428c99f.mp3", "Let's try this new game, Nam!": "audio/cau/9540039a577e2fee.mp3", "Hoa tried hard, and she didn't give up.": "audio/cau/deeed17a1fca8206.mp3", "A flat is a type of house.": "audio/cau/b519e22f39271e2a.mp3", "What type of house do you like? I like this kind.": "audio/cau/256a68fa7015d647.mp3", "There are many types of houses in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/e5ec6990a0243557.mp3", "A villa is one type of house; which type do you like?": "audio/cau/36ad9745be611d00.mp3", "Below are some of the typical things I did.": "audio/cau/66d53ae758a3f7b4.mp3", "Pho is a typical Vietnamese breakfast.": "audio/cau/fbe03a0e67ca0879.mp3", "'Water' is an uncountable noun.": "audio/cau/b22b0a460590466b.mp3", "'Apple' is countable, but 'rice' is uncountable.": "audio/cau/2274c980b271b6b0.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "Minh used his pocket money to buy books.": "audio/cau/8d9cef6778350b8f.mp3", "Mi used her phone to take photos, and it was very useful.": "audio/cau/ee5a3633f90de6fb.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "She is using a computer to write her story.": "audio/cau/c0867dfe4d3cf7aa.mp3", "Minh used a map yesterday, and today he is using his phone.": "audio/cau/2f51e71c740b9c6e.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "There are too many vehicles in the city.": "audio/cau/eaf768a97f85964d.mp3", "A bus is a public vehicle; a motorbike is a private one.": "audio/cau/ba7192e0b47b65bc.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "Mi talks to Nick on a video call.": "audio/cau/7ffc18e81364c319.mp3", "We watch a video about stilt houses.": "audio/cau/2a7f65066f157bbb.mp3", "Our future city will have virtual reality cinemas.": "audio/cau/068d4ffadfdebebd.mp3", "In virtual reality, the trip looks real.": "audio/cau/ec7c5277e556e2a8.mp3", "I want to go to the summer camp.": "audio/cau/16ac9d133b953dea.mp3", "Minh wanted a new bike, and he still wants one.": "audio/cau/74bcc5e39e26178a.mp3", "Mi wants to live in a big city.": "audio/cau/8d3e0f754ef95b04.mp3", "Nam wants to be a doctor because he wants to help people.": "audio/cau/c9ea53f361e19fe4.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "Workers wear helmets at work.": "audio/cau/58cc64267deb5ef1.mp3", "Mi usually wears jeans, but yesterday she wore a dress.": "audio/cau/23bb4a0107f750d1.mp3", "She is wearing a white T-shirt.": "audio/cau/2026d341ee2515db.mp3", "Nam wore jeans yesterday, but today he is wearing trousers.": "audio/cau/f93860f5b315d691.mp3", "The electrician wears a uniform.": "audio/cau/e61ef88174b570fe.mp3", "Lan wears glasses, and she wore them in the photo too.": "audio/cau/930bd22d0c295d4b.mp3", "Complete the word web with types of house.": "audio/cau/030471878c4c327d.mp3", "There is a spider's web in the garden.": "audio/cau/62f4eaf1ea13dd1c.mp3", "Visit our website for more information.": "audio/cau/ac9737600d9243d7.mp3", "Nam made a website for his class.": "audio/cau/ce79a65c937dfd29.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "An electrician repairs electrical wires.": "audio/cau/5bd67bd22095f6f4.mp3", "Don't touch that wire; it is dangerous.": "audio/cau/ac1eb36f22d36289.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "She was one of the most famous scientists in the world.": "audio/cau/60bcc9b6651e1a00.mp3", "Pho is famous all over the world.": "audio/cau/5cc0d2280fff73e9.mp3", "Their products are sold worldwide.": "audio/cau/33dc1c140e6b7e3c.mp3", "This game is popular all over the world.": "audio/cau/6841bcd23e5d5707.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "My aunt is a writer.": "audio/cau/0b898dc7eb5824c9.mp3", "Mi wants to be a writer because she loves to write stories.": "audio/cau/5ce118b1d0da266b.mp3", "She was writing a book when I phoned her.": "audio/cau/97a3ce971a3a7562.mp3", "Mi is writing a letter, and she wrote one yesterday too.": "audio/cau/f5189e5fac049044.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3"};
